  << /ActualText (Redesigned the Truck1 online marketplace from the ground up\054 modernizing the entire platform in the absence of a design system or documentation\056 Created a scalable design library\054 built mobile\055first responsive layouts and introduced intuitive navigation and filtering\056 Supported localization in 32 languages\054 including complex RTL \050right\055to\055left\051 scripts like Arabic\056 Used Hotjar analytics and direct sales team feedback to guide UX decisions and optimize for user behaviour\056)
