  << /ActualText (I started by working on visual design projects\054 creating materials for social media\054 websites and print \023 such as posters\054 business cards and banners\056 I also collaborated with printing houses and adapted visuals for different platforms\054 which helped me develop a strong sense for layout\054 colour and communication through design\056\n\nAs I became more interested in UX\057UI\054 I began working on concept\055based projects to explore user\055centered design and improve my skills through hands\055on learning\056\n\nDesigned a wide range of visual assets for social media\054 websites\054 print materials and advertising campaigns\056)
